# Ansible Copy Module: Deploy `index.html` Across Stratos DC Application Servers

## Overview
Configured an Ansible inventory and playbook on `jump-host` (`/home/thor/ansible`) to distribute `/usr/src/security/index.html` to `/opt/security/index.html` across all three Nautilus application servers (`stapp01`, `stapp02`, `stapp03`) using privilege escalation (`become: yes`).

## Infrastructure & File Paths
* **Control Node:** `jump-host` (`/home/thor/ansible`)
* **Inventory File:** `/home/thor/ansible/inventory`
* **Playbook File:** `/home/thor/ansible/playbook.yml`
* **Source File:** `/usr/src/security/index.html` (on `jump-host`)
* **Destination Path:** `/opt/security/index.html` (on `stapp01`, `stapp02`, `stapp03`)

